    "Because the encryption master key is derived solely from the entered passcode, if you forget your passcode, no one—including the developer—can decrypt or recover videos in the vault. Please make sure to choose a passcode you will not forget.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Because the encryption master key is derived solely from the entered passcode, if you forget your passcode, no one—including the developer—can decrypt or recover videos in the vault. Please make sure to choose a passcode you will not forget."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暗号化マスター鍵は入力されたパスコードのみから導出されるため、パスコードを忘れた場合は開発者を含め誰も保管庫内の動画を復号・復旧することはできません。必ず忘れない番号をご設定ください。"
          }
        }
      }
