    "HLS is not in fMP4 (Fragmented MP4 / #EXT-X-MAP) format (%@). For MPEG-TS (.ts) format, please save with \"Offline HLS\".": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HLS is not in fMP4 (Fragmented MP4 / #EXT-X-MAP) format (%@). For MPEG-TS (.ts) format, please save with \"Offline HLS\"."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "fMP4（Fragmented MP4 / #EXT-X-MAP）形式のHLSではありません（%@）。MPEG-TS（.ts）形式は「オフラインHLS」で保存してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HLS will not be converted to MP4. It is saved in Apple's standard offline format and can only be played within ClipHarbor. Unsupported or DRM-protected streams cannot be saved.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HLS will not be converted to MP4. It is saved in Apple's standard offline format and can only be played within ClipHarbor. Unsupported or DRM-protected streams cannot be saved."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HLSはMP4に変換されません。Apple標準のオフライン形式で保存され、ClipHarbor内でのみ再生できます。対応していない配信やDRM保護された配信は保存できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
