    "Target is unencrypted VOD fMP4 HLS (unified or separate audio). Even if check passes, saving will not complete until converted quality verification succeeds. Encrypted, DRM, live streams, and MPEG-TS are not eligible for MP4 conversion.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Target is unencrypted VOD fMP4 HLS (unified or separate audio). Even if check passes, saving will not complete until converted quality verification succeeds. Encrypted, DRM, live streams, and MPEG-TS are not eligible for MP4 conversion."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "対象は暗号化されていないfMP4形式のVOD HLS（映像・音声統合型／分離音声型）です。判定に合格しても、変換後の品質検証に合格するまで保存は完了しません。暗号化・DRM・ライブ配信・MPEG-TS形式はMP4変換の対象外です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
